# chezmoi modify_ scripts: POSIX shell scripts that carry their target's
# extension (chezmoi naming). oxfmt would parse them as TOML/JSON and corrupt
# them. The .tmpl suffix already keeps oxfmt off the templated ones today; they
# are listed anyway so a future rename or a wider extension map cannot silently
# mangle them.
dot_config/private_agent-of-empires/modify_private_config.toml
dot_claude/modify_settings.json.tmpl
dot_junie/mcp/modify_mcp.json.tmpl
